            <div xml:id="d445">

                <pb facs="0628" n="504" xml:id="pg504"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/3286: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Crane</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-03-02T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 2, 1921—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>82. Your 103, March 1, 1 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department has nothing to add to its number 3, January 5, 5 p.m., and 60,
                    February 8, 7 p.m., by which you should be guided in the matter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
